# Pairs with EventualConvergence in ReplicationCausalDelivery. The drain is
# never able to run, so an entry parked before its dependency arrived stays
# in the buffer for ever even though the dependency is merged.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceDrainNeverReleases
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the buffer is never drained, so a parked entry is stranded after its dependency arrives
PERTURBS: Drain
DEADLOCK: off

--- FIND
Drain ==
    /\ wake
--- REPLACE
Drain ==
\* MUTATION: no drain ever runs.
    /\ FALSE
    /\ wake
--- END
